WEBVTT

01:42.160 --> 01:44.039
I want to drive trucks because

01:44.240 --> 01:45.000
every time I set out,

01:45.000 --> 01:46.039
I get to go somewhere different

01:46.160 --> 01:46.960
and see different scenery.

01:48.080 --> 01:48.840
But I think

01:49.120 --> 01:50.240
from what your parents want,

01:50.520 --> 01:51.840
a boat captain or the mahjong parlor,

01:52.039 --> 01:53.200
you have to inherit one of them.

01:53.560 --> 01:55.520
That's the fallback they left me.

01:56.039 --> 01:56.880
Actually,

01:57.280 --> 01:58.640
fishermen all hope their children

01:58.640 --> 01:59.400
can come back to shore.

01:59.520 --> 02:00.400
Take my dad, for example.

02:00.720 --> 02:01.680
My dad is like a shark.

02:01.880 --> 02:03.000
He loves thrashing around in the sea.

02:03.600 --> 02:04.720
I'm a wild dog.

02:04.720 --> 02:05.320
So I have to...

02:05.320 --> 02:06.880
I have to run wild on the road.

02:08.960 --> 02:10.120
Is that a dog bark?

02:10.400 --> 02:11.120
That's a wolf.

02:11.160 --> 02:12.040
I... I'm a wild wolf.

02:12.040 --> 02:12.760
I'm a wild wolf. A wild wolf.

02:12.760 --> 02:13.240
Who

02:13.240 --> 02:14.840
calls himself a wild dog?

02:14.880 --> 02:15.600
Slip of the tongue.

02:16.520 --> 02:16.960
Qing Ye.

02:17.200 --> 02:18.120
What do you want to do in the future?

02:21.600 --> 02:22.280
I want to make money.

02:23.120 --> 02:24.120
Pretty direct.

02:24.440 --> 02:25.040
Just money?

02:25.200 --> 02:25.760
Nothing else? Yes.

02:27.040 --> 02:27.720
That's pretty shallow.

02:28.640 --> 02:29.560
It's practical.

02:29.760 --> 02:30.440
Once I make money,

02:30.680 --> 02:31.280
I can do

02:31.280 --> 02:32.680
what I want to do.

02:33.079 --> 02:34.400
Money gives me security.

02:34.720 --> 02:35.920
And I can protect my family

02:35.920 --> 02:36.560
from storms.

02:38.079 --> 02:38.520
What about you?

02:39.079 --> 02:39.920
Do you have any goals?

02:40.320 --> 02:40.760
Me?

02:41.800 --> 02:42.200
No.

02:43.640 --> 02:44.600
No dreams?

02:45.560 --> 02:47.200
I used to want to be a pilot.

02:47.760 --> 02:48.360
And now?

02:48.960 --> 02:49.640
Not anymore.

02:50.360 --> 02:51.120
People without dreams

02:51.120 --> 02:52.240
can still live good lives.

02:54.680 --> 02:56.040
Don't keep grilling Wu.

02:56.320 --> 02:56.960
Compared to Wu,

02:57.000 --> 02:57.880
we want to know more about you.

02:59.000 --> 02:59.680
What about me?

03:01.120 --> 03:01.960
For example,

03:02.680 --> 03:03.080
girls like you

03:03.080 --> 03:04.160
from the city.

03:04.640 --> 03:05.640
What kind of boys do you like?

03:07.960 --> 03:08.880
What are you doing?

03:08.920 --> 03:09.640
I mean,

03:10.200 --> 03:12.280
by "like,"

03:13.080 --> 03:14.680
I mean admire,

03:14.760 --> 03:16.079
respect, look up to.

03:16.120 --> 03:17.240
You're reading too much into it.

03:18.520 --> 03:19.200
Well,

03:19.880 --> 03:21.400
I like

03:22.520 --> 03:23.320
boys with good grades.

03:24.840 --> 03:26.280
Then I'm out, huh?

03:26.520 --> 03:28.400
Go look at yourself by the sea.

03:28.520 --> 03:29.640
Wash your face and come back.

03:30.400 --> 03:31.640
If I start working hard now,

03:31.640 --> 03:32.480
is there still time?

03:32.600 --> 03:33.560
Why ask me?

03:33.760 --> 03:34.840
You took two years off school.

03:34.840 --> 03:36.040
We're about the same level.

03:36.440 --> 03:37.360
Then it's too late.

03:38.560 --> 03:39.520
Of course it's not too late.

03:40.640 --> 03:41.360
When it comes to studying,

03:41.800 --> 03:42.760
as long as you want to start,

03:43.760 --> 03:44.800
it's never too late.

03:49.240 --> 03:50.320
Then let's work hard and try.

03:51.680 --> 03:52.040
Come on.

03:52.079 --> 03:52.840
Come on. Another toast.

03:53.400 --> 03:54.079
Good luck to you.

03:54.120 --> 03:54.880
Kyle! Kyle Hao!

03:54.960 --> 03:55.200
Come on.

03:55.440 --> 03:58.160
You really will succeed.

06:03.880 --> 06:04.760
You're up so early.

06:07.080 --> 06:07.880
I couldn't sleep.

06:08.800 --> 06:09.240
What about you?

06:10.080 --> 06:11.280
Up this early to watch the sea?

06:12.680 --> 06:13.520
I couldn't sleep either.

06:14.640 --> 06:16.000
I came out for a walk

06:16.640 --> 06:17.600
and to think about some things.

06:19.040 --> 06:19.520
What things?

06:21.000 --> 06:21.800
Yesterday you asked me

06:22.280 --> 06:23.120
if I had a dream.

06:24.040 --> 06:24.720
I said no.

06:25.840 --> 06:26.680
Actually, it's not that I don't.

06:28.720 --> 06:29.680
I just haven't figured it out yet.

06:32.680 --> 06:34.280
If you haven't, take your time.

06:34.840 --> 06:35.800
Like you said,

06:36.200 --> 06:37.680
some people don't have dreams

06:38.240 --> 06:39.280
and still live well, don't they?

06:41.720 --> 06:42.640
But there's one thing

06:43.400 --> 06:44.240
I've figured out.

06:44.880 --> 06:45.360
What?

06:47.159 --> 06:47.920
I want to go to college.

06:53.760 --> 06:54.680
College?

06:55.120 --> 06:55.840
That's it?

06:59.520 --> 07:00.320
College

07:01.360 --> 07:02.120
can't be a bad choice.

07:06.680 --> 07:07.560
Why

07:08.680 --> 07:10.320
did you suddenly make up your mind?

07:13.160 --> 07:13.840
Because

07:23.080 --> 07:24.240
I want to try

07:24.840 --> 07:25.920
what it feels like to be a good student.

08:07.680 --> 08:09.520
See? I told you.

08:09.760 --> 08:12.400
What parent wouldn't agree

08:12.400 --> 08:13.600
when a kid wants to go back to school?

08:13.960 --> 08:15.440
Besides, I saw her dad's

08:15.440 --> 08:16.440
condition too.

08:16.600 --> 08:17.440
He isn't someone

08:17.440 --> 08:18.880
who can't be reasoned with.

08:19.760 --> 08:20.200
Exactly.

08:20.240 --> 08:21.160
Just as I expected.

08:21.520 --> 08:22.920
Unlike our Wu.

08:23.360 --> 08:24.640
To get him back to school,

08:24.640 --> 08:25.680
you have to beg him.

08:26.000 --> 08:26.720
Good thing

08:27.080 --> 08:28.600
Qing Ye stepped in herself.

08:28.840 --> 08:29.320
Grandma.

08:29.720 --> 08:31.600
Your favorite sea urchin egg custard.

08:31.800 --> 08:32.320
You eat first. Okay.

08:32.400 --> 08:32.840
See?

08:33.280 --> 08:35.000
My grandson is still the most filial.

08:36.600 --> 08:37.679
Here, Mom. Have some soup.

08:37.720 --> 08:38.880
Okay. Thank you. Thank you.

08:39.159 --> 08:39.600
Ye.

08:39.840 --> 08:41.679
I heard you're forming

08:42.120 --> 08:43.000
with Shi Min

08:43.240 --> 08:44.920
some kind of study group

08:44.920 --> 08:46.280
or study squad?

08:46.520 --> 08:47.920
Just a study group.

08:48.880 --> 08:50.320
Since everyone needs to study,

08:50.520 --> 08:51.280
we might as well get together

08:51.400 --> 08:52.520
and help each other.

08:54.080 --> 08:55.760
Then what about Wu?

08:55.960 --> 08:57.400
I'll join when I have time.

08:57.880 --> 08:58.880
He's so good already.

08:58.880 --> 09:00.600
At his level, he can study on his own.

09:00.680 --> 09:01.520
No way.

09:01.800 --> 09:02.880
I've been out of school so long.

09:03.120 --> 09:04.000
If I have questions,

09:04.280 --> 09:05.320
I still need to ask

09:05.440 --> 09:06.960
Zhazhating's outstanding educator,

09:07.280 --> 09:07.960
Teacher Qing Ye.

09:10.560 --> 09:11.680
Wu, since when

09:11.720 --> 09:13.200
did you get so good with words?

09:13.280 --> 09:14.880
I've learned by watching Teacher Qing Ye.

09:15.080 --> 09:15.840
Here, have some egg.

09:17.440 --> 09:19.360
Study hard, ask questions, keep at it.

09:19.520 --> 09:20.360
From now on,

09:20.360 --> 09:22.960
study hard with Teacher Qing Ye.

09:23.800 --> 09:24.320
Teacher Qing Ye.

09:24.320 --> 09:25.240
You're too kind. Too kind.

09:25.240 --> 09:25.880
Come on. Try this.

09:25.920 --> 09:26.800
Auntie's scrambled eggs.

09:26.800 --> 09:27.520
Thank you.

09:27.560 --> 09:29.160
Teacher Qing Ye.

09:30.200 --> 09:31.240
Teacher Qing Ye, have some fish.

09:31.680 --> 09:32.520
It's good. It's good.

09:32.560 --> 09:33.800
Watch out for bones.

09:36.680 --> 09:37.520
Leave it. I'll do it.

09:38.920 --> 09:39.920
What's hard about washing dishes?

09:40.160 --> 09:41.200
I've even shucked oysters.

09:42.520 --> 09:43.760
Aren't you supposed to tutor me?

09:44.160 --> 09:45.080
You need to prepare, right?

09:47.240 --> 09:47.800
All right.

09:48.120 --> 09:49.880
I'll go prepare the questions.

09:49.960 --> 09:50.760
I'll wait upstairs.

09:50.960 --> 09:51.880
Okay. Ten minutes.

09:53.960 --> 09:54.520
Wait.

09:55.840 --> 09:56.600
Give me the apron.

09:58.720 --> 09:59.240
Right, right.

10:45.360 --> 10:46.600
Sis, what are you washing?

10:47.000 --> 10:47.720
Clothes.

10:48.840 --> 10:49.920
You come here to do laundry too?

10:50.600 --> 10:51.680
Yes. I'm collecting towels.

10:53.320 --> 10:55.200
More cardboard boxes piled up.

10:55.520 --> 10:56.840
Those are Zhang's, right?

10:58.120 --> 10:58.720
Probably.

11:00.920 --> 11:01.520
Zhang.

11:03.000 --> 11:03.720
Zhang.

11:05.200 --> 11:06.720
What decade is this?

11:06.960 --> 11:08.480
Why keep so many cardboard boxes?

11:08.520 --> 11:09.600
Get rid of them.

11:10.640 --> 11:12.520
They won't sell for much anyway.

11:12.880 --> 11:14.080
If you run into

11:14.120 --> 11:15.120
a cigarette butt

11:15.120 --> 11:15.760
or something,

11:16.000 --> 11:17.000
and it starts a fire,

11:17.000 --> 11:17.920
what then?

11:18.800 --> 11:19.640
Zhang.

11:20.040 --> 11:20.760
Okay, okay.

11:20.880 --> 11:21.800
I know, Lanfang.

11:22.000 --> 11:22.880
Hurry up.

11:33.760 --> 11:34.840
What happened to ten minutes?

11:35.600 --> 11:36.240
Washing dishes

11:36.560 --> 11:37.600
and taking off the apron took ten minutes.

11:40.320 --> 11:41.760
I tied it into a knot by accident.

11:42.520 --> 11:42.960
Come on.

11:43.560 --> 11:44.200
Do the problems.

11:45.400 --> 11:46.040
Let's treat it as a placement test.

11:46.200 --> 11:46.760
After this,

11:46.960 --> 11:48.080
we'll practice based on your weak spots.

11:49.240 --> 11:49.880
Just start.

11:51.680 --> 11:52.120
Take your time.

11:52.960 --> 11:53.600
I'll stay with you.

11:55.320 --> 11:55.680
Okay.

12:22.000 --> 12:23.440
ABCD.

12:23.440 --> 12:26.040
The base ABCD is a rhombus.

12:26.840 --> 12:28.760
This side is length four.

12:29.200 --> 12:30.960
And this side is length two.

12:31.600 --> 12:33.040
What you need to prove

12:33.200 --> 12:34.440
is that this line

12:34.800 --> 12:36.080
and this inclined plane

12:36.520 --> 12:37.720
are parallel.

12:38.080 --> 12:38.880
How do we prove that?

12:38.880 --> 12:40.600
First, draw an auxiliary line.

12:40.720 --> 12:42.200
Once you prove these two angles

12:42.560 --> 12:43.600
are both ninety degrees,

12:43.680 --> 12:45.360
you prove it's parallel

12:45.560 --> 12:46.520
to this plane.

12:46.560 --> 12:47.040
Right?

12:50.320 --> 12:50.640
Right.

12:50.640 --> 12:52.320
Don't look at me. Did you get it?

12:52.520 --> 12:53.040
I got it.

12:53.320 --> 12:53.960
Good. You got it.

12:54.000 --> 12:54.880
Apply it to another one. Here.

12:55.400 --> 12:56.760
This is similar. Geometry too.

12:56.760 --> 12:58.040
Try this one for me.

12:58.960 --> 13:00.160
AA1 equals four.

13:00.400 --> 13:01.320
AB2 equals two.

13:02.680 --> 13:04.720
MN is parallel to the plane.

13:05.320 --> 13:07.360
Prove this is parallel to this.

13:07.920 --> 13:08.920
It's not on this plane.

13:39.880 --> 13:41.200
Youth is wonderful.

13:41.320 --> 13:42.720
Learning never ends.

13:43.720 --> 13:43.960
Here.

13:43.960 --> 13:45.400
They're still studying?

13:45.400 --> 13:46.400
Yes.

13:47.160 --> 13:49.680
Study by lamplight through the night,

13:50.000 --> 13:52.400
that's exactly when young men should read.

13:53.120 --> 13:54.040
Can I have some water?

13:54.240 --> 13:55.280
Yes, yes, yes.

13:56.000 --> 13:57.080
Wu is still young.

13:57.840 --> 13:59.960
He has a long road ahead.

14:00.520 --> 14:01.880
He needs to study more

14:02.120 --> 14:03.760
to have a better future.

14:03.960 --> 14:05.920
Yes, yes. Exactly.

14:06.080 --> 14:07.520
We can't always let Wu

14:07.560 --> 14:08.800
worry about this family.

14:09.640 --> 14:11.240
Seeing the kids work so hard,

14:11.320 --> 14:12.320
I need to try harder too.

14:14.280 --> 14:14.960
I know.

14:14.960 --> 14:17.560
Xuan Island has been doing well lately.

14:18.400 --> 14:19.720
As the boss lady,

14:20.040 --> 14:20.800
you're very successful.

14:23.000 --> 14:23.880
Mom, do you know?

14:24.360 --> 14:26.760
Since Xuan Island reopened,

14:26.840 --> 14:28.320
we have way more customers than before.

14:28.720 --> 14:30.320
Now everyone knows

14:30.680 --> 14:31.760
that I, Li Lanfang,

14:31.800 --> 14:33.280
have all five certificates,

14:33.360 --> 14:34.880
so they feel safer.

14:36.280 --> 14:37.000
So to speak,

14:37.520 --> 14:39.320
even a setback can have a silver lining.

14:39.600 --> 14:40.400
Sometimes bad things

14:40.440 --> 14:41.640
can turn into good things.

14:42.520 --> 14:43.040
Exactly.

14:43.400 --> 14:44.240
I want

14:44.800 --> 14:46.320
to ride this momentum

14:46.880 --> 14:48.560
and expand my hairdressing career.

14:51.520 --> 14:52.320
Tell me about it.

14:54.240 --> 14:56.000
Recently, I saw online

14:56.760 --> 14:58.520
that the hottest thing now

14:58.560 --> 14:59.720
is updos.

15:00.320 --> 15:01.240
I'm planning

15:01.480 --> 15:02.720
to go learn it.

15:15.520 --> 15:16.000
What do you think?

15:16.360 --> 15:16.760
Some parts

15:20.960 --> 15:21.920
of your writing

15:22.640 --> 15:23.320
are hard to follow.

15:23.920 --> 15:25.000
Which ones? Let me see.

15:33.560 --> 15:35.160
Your essay is

15:35.520 --> 15:36.560
a little weak.

15:37.880 --> 15:39.120
After all these years,

15:39.560 --> 15:40.960
I've forgotten almost all the words.

15:41.440 --> 15:42.000
My English

15:42.000 --> 15:42.960
wasn't very good before anyway.

15:44.080 --> 15:45.200
Memorizing words is too hard.

15:45.840 --> 15:46.520
They know me,

15:46.680 --> 15:47.360
but I don't know them.

15:50.560 --> 15:51.520
Do you know the Ebbinghaus

15:51.520 --> 15:52.400
forgetting curve?

15:54.160 --> 15:54.600
What?

15:54.920 --> 15:56.680
The Ebbinghaus forgetting curve.

15:58.440 --> 16:00.320
I think I've heard of it.

16:00.800 --> 16:01.520
It works like this.

16:02.400 --> 16:03.400
The Y-axis here

16:03.400 --> 16:04.840
is the amount remembered.

16:05.200 --> 16:07.160
The X-axis here

16:07.400 --> 16:08.840
is the number of days

16:08.840 --> 16:09.760
after you learn something.

16:10.720 --> 16:12.520
As time passes,

16:12.840 --> 16:14.520
what you remember

16:14.680 --> 16:16.000
gradually gets forgotten.

16:17.400 --> 16:18.000
No wonder.

16:18.400 --> 16:19.560
I was wondering why I forgot everything.

16:20.360 --> 16:21.120
So,

16:21.720 --> 16:23.200
you need to keep memorizing,

16:23.560 --> 16:24.760
reviewing,

16:24.760 --> 16:26.160
and reinforcing.

16:26.400 --> 16:27.880
Of course, don't make it painful.

16:27.920 --> 16:28.520
For example,

16:29.000 --> 16:30.000
watching TV shows

16:30.200 --> 16:31.280
or listening to music

16:32.040 --> 16:34.200
can all be ways to fragmented learning.

16:36.240 --> 16:37.520
So you have to push me more.

16:37.560 --> 16:39.200
Make me do more papers and problems.

16:41.840 --> 16:42.760
As long as I keep memorizing,

16:43.560 --> 16:43.920
once memorize it,

16:44.640 --> 16:45.400
I'll use it someday.

16:45.920 --> 16:46.680
One correct usage will ...

17:06.800 --> 17:07.240
Qing Ye.

17:10.280 --> 17:11.119
Are you sleepy?

17:13.880 --> 17:15.240
I think I am.

17:15.240 --> 17:15.960
It's so late.

17:16.640 --> 17:18.760
Let's stop here for today.

17:20.800 --> 17:21.160
Okay.

17:22.440 --> 17:23.760
Get some rest.

18:47.880 --> 18:48.520
Mom.

18:49.520 --> 18:50.640
You told me

18:51.320 --> 18:53.880
that helping others enriches yourself too.

19:00.440 --> 19:02.640
So what you gain from studying

19:02.680 --> 19:03.840
isn't just grades.

19:04.320 --> 19:05.400
It's also a sense of achievement.

19:07.520 --> 19:09.800
Responsibility brings pressure,

19:10.720 --> 19:11.680
but life

19:12.000 --> 19:13.760
seems to gain meaning from it.

19:14.800 --> 19:15.720
All of this

19:16.280 --> 19:17.560
makes me feel

19:17.680 --> 19:19.640
a tiny bit more hopeful about the future.

19:21.160 --> 19:21.880
Wrong.

19:24.240 --> 19:25.520
You have to do it again.

19:29.720 --> 19:30.520
Good people

19:31.000 --> 19:32.040
aren't afraid of being misunderstood.

19:33.240 --> 19:35.160
Good food is worth the wait.

19:35.800 --> 19:37.800
Good things take time.

19:58.520 --> 19:59.960
You finished all?

20:00.440 --> 20:00.960
Yes.

20:06.040 --> 20:07.680
Did you sleep last night?

20:09.200 --> 20:10.040
No.

20:10.520 --> 20:10.920
Why?

20:11.280 --> 20:14.040
I was thinking all night.

20:15.680 --> 20:16.800
About what?

20:17.960 --> 20:20.120
About you.

20:23.600 --> 20:25.760
You mean you were thinking about

20:26.200 --> 20:30.000
the study methods I taught you?

20:33.160 --> 20:33.800
Never mind.

20:38.160 --> 20:39.440
You did pretty well on this paper.

20:39.440 --> 20:40.560
You even wrote the essay.

20:40.880 --> 20:42.320
Not bad. Your speaking is improved too.

20:42.600 --> 20:44.240
Please speak English.

20:45.520 --> 20:46.640
Okay. Fine.

20:47.720 --> 20:49.760
Let me treat you breakfast

20:50.120 --> 20:51.040
to fresh your head.

20:51.760 --> 20:52.760
Only breakfast?

20:53.640 --> 20:54.440
What else do you want?

20:55.600 --> 20:57.240
I want...

20:58.200 --> 20:58.920
Wait, wait, wait.

21:00.440 --> 21:01.600
Hurry up.

21:06.520 --> 21:07.080
Let's race.

21:07.440 --> 21:08.400
First one to the bus stop wins.

21:09.000 --> 21:09.720
Hold these. Hold these.

21:10.320 --> 21:10.640
Fine. Race it is.

21:10.640 --> 21:11.560
I'll run when I count to three.

21:11.760 --> 21:12.360
Ready.

21:12.560 --> 21:13.000
One.

21:15.840 --> 21:16.760
Wait, I...

21:21.960 --> 21:22.840
Not bad. Not bad.

21:23.400 --> 21:24.840
Your accuracy is up.

21:25.920 --> 21:27.320
Your reading is good too.

21:28.320 --> 21:29.600
We'll make it harder from now on.

21:30.320 --> 21:30.680
Okay.

21:31.640 --> 21:32.800
For cloze tests,

21:32.800 --> 21:33.800
you still need to pay attention

21:33.800 --> 21:34.440
to tense.

21:36.000 --> 21:36.480
Got it.

21:39.000 --> 21:39.560
Hello.

21:39.560 --> 21:40.360
Senior pass.

21:44.280 --> 21:45.400
Grandma, you can sit here.

21:48.600 --> 21:49.720
Thank you, young lady.

21:49.800 --> 21:50.440
You're so kind.

22:11.440 --> 22:11.920
Hold on to me.

22:43.240 --> 22:43.800
Hold tight.

22:51.200 --> 22:51.920
Still listening practice?

22:54.600 --> 22:55.000
Yes.

22:55.400 --> 22:55.800
Yes.

23:21.160 --> 23:22.000
Shi Min, breakfast.

23:22.840 --> 23:24.000
Thanks.

23:25.000 --> 23:26.240
My favorite buns.

23:27.200 --> 23:27.560
Morning.

23:29.360 --> 23:30.600
That's seriously healthy.

24:10.920 --> 24:11.920
You kids, come in and sit.

24:11.960 --> 24:12.440
Come on, hurry.

24:12.520 --> 24:12.920
Hello, Director.

24:12.920 --> 24:13.320
Come on.

24:13.360 --> 24:13.720
Hello, Director.

24:13.720 --> 24:14.440
Come in. Sit down.

24:14.520 --> 24:14.920
Hello, Director.

24:15.160 --> 24:15.880
Hello, Director Yang.

24:16.080 --> 24:16.800
Hello, Director Yang.

24:17.120 --> 24:17.600
Sit down.

24:17.960 --> 24:18.440
All right.

24:18.560 --> 24:19.640
Everyone here? Sit down.

24:20.520 --> 24:21.880
I heard the study atmosphere

24:21.920 --> 24:23.400
has been very strong lately.

24:23.800 --> 24:24.560
Director Yang has good news

24:24.560 --> 24:25.280
to tell you.

24:26.200 --> 24:27.800
The joint winter camp

24:27.800 --> 24:28.760
held by the city's universities

24:28.840 --> 24:29.440
this year

24:29.440 --> 24:31.000
has given Anzi High one spot.

24:31.400 --> 24:32.080
You've all heard

24:32.080 --> 24:33.280
of this winter camp, right?

24:33.920 --> 24:34.640
Yes.

24:35.040 --> 24:35.520
Director,

24:35.560 --> 24:36.640
when will it be held?

24:36.800 --> 24:38.160
This winter break, before New Year.

24:38.440 --> 24:39.200
This winter camp

24:39.200 --> 24:41.320
is held every winter.

24:41.400 --> 24:42.080
But

24:42.080 --> 24:43.440
the spot we're getting this year

24:43.520 --> 24:45.280
is unprecedented.

24:45.320 --> 24:46.080
In the past,

24:46.080 --> 24:47.760
we never got a chance

24:47.960 --> 24:48.520
at great programs like this.

24:48.520 --> 24:49.960
This time, if you get to go,

24:50.120 --> 24:51.200
you'll not only have the chance

24:51.240 --> 24:53.880
to exchange and compete

24:53.960 --> 24:55.280
with top students from city high schools,

24:55.440 --> 24:56.080
but you'll also receive

24:56.120 --> 24:57.240
free guidance from great teachers.

24:57.720 --> 24:58.360
Director.

24:58.520 --> 25:00.320
That's not exactly good news.

25:00.600 --> 25:02.320
One spot isn't enough to share.

25:02.520 --> 25:03.280
That's why

25:03.520 --> 25:04.960
Mr. Sun

25:04.960 --> 25:05.720
and Mr. Zhu

25:05.760 --> 25:07.160
will prepare

25:07.160 --> 25:07.880
a selection quiz for you.

25:08.240 --> 25:09.360
The questions will be

25:09.360 --> 25:10.120
harder than usual.

25:10.360 --> 25:12.000
You're all in the top five of the grade.

25:12.160 --> 25:13.200
Prepare well.

25:13.400 --> 25:14.360
The winner goes.

25:15.600 --> 25:16.360
Director, teachers.

25:16.960 --> 25:17.720
May I apply

25:17.880 --> 25:19.440
to withdraw from the selection?

25:20.280 --> 25:20.840
Why?

25:21.000 --> 25:21.640
You're withdrawing?

25:23.640 --> 25:24.080
Ye Yingjian.

25:24.360 --> 25:26.000
You're the best

25:26.040 --> 25:27.080
and most consistent

25:27.120 --> 25:27.920
student in this senior class.

25:28.240 --> 25:29.360
This is such a rare chance.

25:29.640 --> 25:30.360
You can use

25:30.360 --> 25:31.000
the winter break

25:31.000 --> 25:31.840
to improve yourself.

25:32.680 --> 25:34.200
I know it's a rare chance.

25:34.560 --> 25:35.920
That's why I think other students

25:35.920 --> 25:37.080
need it more.

25:37.520 --> 25:38.400
And

25:39.240 --> 25:40.680
I have other plans this winter break.

25:41.680 --> 25:42.440
What plans?

25:44.720 --> 25:46.640
My dad is taking me abroad.

25:47.400 --> 25:48.560
The tickets are already booked.

25:50.520 --> 25:50.920
All right.

25:51.400 --> 25:52.120
Then the four of you

25:52.160 --> 25:53.200
should prepare well.

25:53.320 --> 25:54.200
Compete fairly.

25:55.040 --> 25:55.680
Yes, Director.

25:56.000 --> 25:56.720
Save some for me.

25:56.760 --> 25:57.880
Save some for me.

26:06.240 --> 26:07.080
Congrats, cousin.

26:07.400 --> 26:08.560
We all heard

26:08.880 --> 26:10.440
you're going to

26:10.520 --> 26:11.880
the joint university winter camp.

26:12.080 --> 26:13.120
Not necessarily.

26:13.160 --> 26:14.240
There's an exam.

26:14.360 --> 26:15.160
A selection.

26:15.760 --> 26:17.400
Ye Yingjian withdrew himself.

26:17.400 --> 26:18.760
Only Cao Fan and the others are left.

26:19.120 --> 26:20.040
None of them can beat you.

26:20.520 --> 26:21.080
I'm telling you,

26:21.600 --> 26:22.600
that spot

26:22.840 --> 26:23.600
is already tightly

26:23.600 --> 26:24.680
locked in your hands.

26:24.800 --> 26:25.240
It can't run away.

26:26.120 --> 26:26.680
Qing Ye.

26:26.840 --> 26:27.960
I heard this winter camp

26:27.960 --> 26:29.200
is really valuable.

26:29.400 --> 26:30.560
Students who attend

26:30.960 --> 26:31.960
have an almost

26:32.440 --> 26:33.320
one hundred percent chance

26:33.320 --> 26:34.240
of getting into a key university.

26:35.360 --> 26:36.720
Then I'll give it my all.

26:37.240 --> 26:37.840
But

26:37.920 --> 26:39.480
whether I go or not,

26:39.600 --> 26:41.360
we still need to study.

26:43.200 --> 26:43.600
Study.

26:44.680 --> 26:45.280
Study hard.

26:46.320 --> 26:47.120
Where's Xing Wu?

26:48.120 --> 26:48.840
He went home after school.

26:49.760 --> 26:51.520
He said Quanya

26:51.600 --> 26:52.800
asked him to help with something small.

26:52.920 --> 26:54.080
He told you to go home first.

26:56.640 --> 26:57.760
He also said

26:58.160 --> 26:59.440
he'll bring you something good.

27:00.280 --> 27:01.840
You're killing me. Just spit it out.

27:07.680 --> 27:08.240
Cao Fan.

27:09.200 --> 27:10.120
Cao Fan.

27:10.240 --> 27:11.240
What are you doing here?

27:13.280 --> 27:13.640
I...

27:15.760 --> 27:16.400
Don't go.

27:18.400 --> 27:20.240
So you live here.

27:21.760 --> 27:23.200
I knew you had a smell on you.

27:23.240 --> 27:24.520
Turns out it's from this shop.

27:26.640 --> 27:27.520
What do you want?

27:27.880 --> 27:29.280
Didn't you say your brother's in Shenzhen

27:29.760 --> 27:31.160
and you lived in a villa?

27:31.800 --> 27:32.440
What do you mean?

27:33.000 --> 27:34.640
Friends at vocational school said

27:34.800 --> 27:36.040
your brother served two years.

27:36.840 --> 27:37.800
Is what they said true?

27:38.280 --> 27:39.000
Of course not.

27:39.320 --> 27:40.600
How could my brother go to prison?

27:40.880 --> 27:41.800
I would never in my life

27:41.800 --> 27:43.120
have anything to do with an ex-con.

27:43.360 --> 27:44.240
Stop talking nonsense.

27:45.320 --> 27:46.360
If it's not true,

27:46.400 --> 27:47.520
why are you mad?

28:26.600 --> 28:27.000
Auntie.

28:27.960 --> 28:28.760
I'll help you wash those.

28:28.920 --> 28:29.960
Give them to me. No need.

28:30.560 --> 28:31.800
I can do it myself.

28:32.080 --> 28:33.080
There's a washing machine.

28:34.160 --> 28:34.880
Good timing.

28:35.240 --> 28:37.120
Keep the shop for me.

28:37.640 --> 28:39.320
I'm going next door for a bit.

28:40.800 --> 28:41.280
Okay.

29:03.920 --> 29:05.160
Still at Shunyi?

29:07.560 --> 29:09.160
Quanya can't fix a new model.

29:09.440 --> 29:10.080
I came to help him.

29:14.280 --> 29:15.840
About when will you be back?

29:19.600 --> 29:20.160
A little later.

29:23.040 --> 29:23.600
Okay.

29:52.840 --> 29:53.720
Is Xing Wu here?

29:56.480 --> 29:57.040
Hello.

29:58.000 --> 29:59.520
Are you here for your hair?

30:02.000 --> 30:03.040
If you want a haircut,

30:03.120 --> 30:04.200
I'll go get the boss lady.

30:04.440 --> 30:05.040
No need.

30:15.400 --> 30:16.160
I'm here for Xing Wu.

30:18.040 --> 30:20.160
But he's out and not back yet.

30:29.360 --> 30:29.760
How about this?

30:30.040 --> 30:31.360
Leave your contact info.

30:31.640 --> 30:33.080
I'll have him call you when he's back.

30:35.800 --> 30:36.600
I'll come another day.

31:11.360 --> 31:12.080
Why are you here?

31:12.880 --> 31:13.640
Waiting for you.

31:14.840 --> 31:15.520
Have you waited long?

31:16.040 --> 31:16.440
No.

31:16.800 --> 31:18.280
Just a little over ten minutes.

31:19.320 --> 31:20.400
The phone Quanya asked you to fix,

31:20.400 --> 31:21.160
is it all done?

31:22.080 --> 31:22.640
All done.

31:23.560 --> 31:24.800
I also stopped by the bookstore

31:25.200 --> 31:26.360
and brought you something good.

31:27.040 --> 31:27.520
Sit.

31:31.160 --> 31:32.600
This is what you call something good?

31:33.360 --> 31:34.560
To push you

31:35.040 --> 31:36.720
and pass the winter camp exam in one shot.

31:38.680 --> 31:40.120
How did you know so fast?

31:40.600 --> 31:41.840
Think about who you're asking.

31:47.640 --> 31:48.600
I have to say,

31:49.080 --> 31:50.800
you chose the right problems.

31:51.280 --> 31:52.560
Just wait until I master them.

31:52.760 --> 31:53.360
I will

31:53.520 --> 31:55.000
lock you in a study room

31:55.200 --> 31:55.920
and make you do

31:55.960 --> 31:57.520
three days and nights of advanced drills.

32:03.600 --> 32:04.520
Don't wait for me next time.

32:06.280 --> 32:06.720
Why?

32:08.240 --> 32:09.120
It's a waste of time.

32:09.680 --> 32:11.080
How is that a waste?

32:11.520 --> 32:12.640
I was tired from studying anyway,

32:12.880 --> 32:14.400
so I came out for a walk and some air.

32:14.640 --> 32:15.240
Besides,

32:15.600 --> 32:15.960
look.

32:16.640 --> 32:18.120
I'm listening to English too.

32:18.320 --> 32:19.240
Two birds with one stone.

32:19.360 --> 32:20.520
Getting the most out of every moment.

32:21.720 --> 32:22.720
Let's go home.

32:24.600 --> 32:25.080
By the way,

32:25.840 --> 32:26.640
just now,

32:27.120 --> 32:28.520
a man came looking for you.

32:29.160 --> 32:29.560
Who?

32:30.320 --> 32:31.040
I don't know him.

32:34.520 --> 32:35.320
It's nothing. Let's go.

32:57.600 --> 32:58.200
Bro.

32:59.240 --> 33:00.120
Bro Cao Ping.

33:06.080 --> 33:06.680
Why are you here?

33:06.960 --> 33:08.400
I brought the boys to welcome you back.

33:12.680 --> 33:13.280
Come in, everyone.

33:13.440 --> 33:13.720
Bro,

33:13.760 --> 33:15.080
I thought you weren't home.

33:15.320 --> 33:16.680
Come on, hurry.

33:19.320 --> 33:20.040
The food. Hurry.

33:20.120 --> 33:20.920
Set it down. Put it here.

33:22.880 --> 33:24.080
These are all your favorites.

33:24.600 --> 33:24.960
Bro.

33:27.440 --> 33:28.320
Call him sir.

33:29.720 --> 33:30.520
Hello, Sir.

33:31.240 --> 33:32.000
All right. Sit down.

33:32.000 --> 33:32.520
Okay, okay.

33:32.880 --> 33:33.600
No, no, no.

33:33.840 --> 33:34.560
Forgive them, Bro.

33:34.680 --> 33:35.840
They're just kids.

33:36.240 --> 33:37.520
They haven't been on the streets long.

33:38.520 --> 33:39.360
Listen up.

33:39.520 --> 33:40.520
When I was inside,

33:40.640 --> 33:41.840
Bro Ping had my back.

33:42.440 --> 33:44.040
Two years ago in Anzi County,

33:44.320 --> 33:45.800
it was all Brother Ping's territory.

33:46.040 --> 33:47.920
You wouldn't know a legend if you saw one.

33:49.360 --> 33:50.080
Eat up. Eat up.

33:51.680 --> 33:52.600
We're welcoming you back.

33:53.160 --> 33:53.560
Bro.

33:55.160 --> 33:56.080
Congratulations on getting out.

34:02.560 --> 34:03.120
Sit down.

34:03.680 --> 34:04.080
Yes, Sir.

34:06.280 --> 34:07.000
Brother Ping.

34:08.800 --> 34:10.520
Now that you're out, what's your plan?

34:12.040 --> 34:12.800
Right now,

34:13.280 --> 34:14.600
my electronics business is doing okay.

34:14.800 --> 34:15.520
In all of Anzi County,

34:15.600 --> 34:16.679
except Shunyi,

34:16.880 --> 34:17.679
everyone knows me.

34:20.719 --> 34:21.520
Except Shunyi?

34:22.960 --> 34:24.120
That place where Xing Wu works.

34:25.840 --> 34:26.440
They usually

34:26.880 --> 34:27.800
fix things for people

34:28.280 --> 34:29.440
scraping by on small change,

34:29.520 --> 34:30.719
trying to compete with us.

34:31.440 --> 34:31.960
But

34:31.960 --> 34:33.000
if you join us,

34:33.320 --> 34:35.199
we'd be at our peak,

34:35.560 --> 34:36.679
at our, uh... whatever that saying is.

34:36.719 --> 34:37.199
Right?

34:37.199 --> 34:37.560
Right.

34:41.639 --> 34:42.080
Brother Ping.

34:43.600 --> 34:44.520
I'm not lecturing you,

34:44.840 --> 34:45.840
but if it were me,

34:45.920 --> 34:46.520
the moment I got out,

34:46.520 --> 34:47.880
I'd go get revenge on them.

34:48.239 --> 34:49.320
Think about those two years.

34:49.360 --> 34:50.040
What did you eat?

34:50.040 --> 34:50.840
What did you drink?

34:51.639 --> 34:52.360
And Xing Wu?

34:52.719 --> 34:53.320
Now,

34:53.400 --> 34:54.639
he's taken over

34:54.639 --> 34:55.360
Mr. Ye's electronics mall.

34:56.120 --> 34:57.640
He's even trying for college now.

34:57.720 --> 34:58.920
If he gets into college,

34:59.320 --> 35:00.520
will he still take us seriously?

35:02.720 --> 35:03.640
What he does has nothing to do with me.

35:04.400 --> 35:05.640
I came out to be a decent man.

35:07.720 --> 35:08.560
Brother Ping, didn't you

35:08.720 --> 35:09.640
ask me to look after your sister?

35:10.040 --> 35:12.520
But Xing Wu's cousin

35:13.560 --> 35:14.720
doesn't get along with your sister.

35:16.280 --> 35:17.120
They're at the same school.

35:28.400 --> 35:28.760
Serve.

35:38.520 --> 35:39.320
Why isn't Wu here yet?

35:40.000 --> 35:41.120
Maybe he overslept.

35:41.280 --> 35:42.520
He's always on time.

35:45.560 --> 35:46.600
Get it. Go get the ball. Hurry.

35:46.800 --> 35:47.560
Consider it a warm-up.

35:49.880 --> 35:50.400
Wu.

35:50.600 --> 35:50.960
Wu.

35:50.960 --> 35:51.640
Why are you so late?

35:52.080 --> 35:53.400
Are you two waiting for me to play

35:53.400 --> 35:54.320
or to fix my bike?

35:54.680 --> 35:55.280
What do you mean?

36:02.440 --> 36:04.080
Who took my wheel off?

36:06.520 --> 36:08.600
Come out and fight me one-on-one.

36:09.120 --> 36:09.520
I...

36:10.320 --> 36:11.800
I can't believe this.

36:12.880 --> 36:13.760
Where's your decency?

36:32.600 --> 36:33.240
Xing Wu.

36:33.560 --> 36:34.000
Come on.

36:38.600 --> 36:40.480
What time is it already?

36:40.760 --> 36:41.960
Why are there still no customers?

36:42.520 --> 36:42.960
Lanfang.

36:43.120 --> 36:44.440
It happens. Some days are slow.

36:44.520 --> 36:45.520
It's been slow too many times.

36:47.760 --> 36:48.520
Here comes a customer.

36:48.560 --> 36:49.280
Haircut?

36:49.640 --> 36:50.560
Welcome.

36:54.720 --> 36:55.440
Stop right there.

36:56.520 --> 36:57.440
Liu Nian.

37:00.520 --> 37:02.320
Fit it in, then tighten it.

37:02.440 --> 37:03.440
I did fit it in.

37:03.440 --> 37:04.720
If it's fitted, what about the brake?

37:04.800 --> 37:05.320
The brake is sticking out.

37:05.320 --> 37:05.720
You do it.

37:06.200 --> 37:07.960
Fine, I'll do it.

37:09.280 --> 37:09.840
Wu.

37:10.040 --> 37:11.280
Xuan Island's window was smashed.

37:15.000 --> 37:16.200
Don't open today.

37:20.680 --> 37:21.040
Come on.

37:24.520 --> 37:26.120
No, no what?

37:34.440 --> 37:35.200
Hello, Officer Xu.

37:36.720 --> 37:37.680
I want to ask about someone.

37:38.440 --> 37:38.840
Go ahead.

37:40.440 --> 37:41.000
Cao Ping.

37:42.400 --> 37:43.360
Has he been released from prison?

37:44.280 --> 37:44.640
Yes.

37:45.280 --> 37:46.360
Just a few days ago.

37:46.920 --> 37:48.040
He even came to the station

37:48.080 --> 37:49.600
to register and report in.

37:52.040 --> 37:52.520
Xing Wu.

37:53.240 --> 37:53.640
Xing Wu.

37:55.040 --> 37:56.000
Did something happen?

37:56.400 --> 37:56.880
I see.

37:57.720 --> 37:58.120
Thank you.

38:10.320 --> 38:10.880
Where are you?

38:20.880 --> 38:22.360
Let's see where you can run this time.

38:22.520 --> 38:23.640
Who are you? What are you doing?

38:26.520 --> 38:27.120
Xing Wu.

38:33.800 --> 38:35.160
Xing Wu, who is he?

38:36.320 --> 38:37.120
Do you know him?

38:37.960 --> 38:38.600
No.

38:40.320 --> 38:40.840
It's fine now.

38:42.680 --> 38:43.640
Let's go home.

38:48.280 --> 38:49.320
Let's go. It's fine.

39:00.840 --> 39:01.320
Screw you.

39:02.560 --> 39:03.320
Xing Wu.

39:04.000 --> 39:04.840
Get out here.

39:07.080 --> 39:07.800
What are you doing?

39:07.960 --> 39:09.040
What's it to you?

39:09.440 --> 39:10.000
Get back inside.

39:11.720 --> 39:12.600
Come out, Xing Wu.

39:13.240 --> 39:14.720
What's going on?

39:18.280 --> 39:18.800
Yang Gang.

39:19.160 --> 39:19.960
We didn't mess with you, did we?

39:20.120 --> 39:21.280
Why keep coming after Shunyi?

39:23.680 --> 39:25.520
Because you stole my business.

39:26.840 --> 39:27.640
I'm telling you,

39:28.280 --> 39:30.000
this turf is mine.

39:30.440 --> 39:31.600
Don't say I didn't warn you.

39:31.800 --> 39:33.080
This isn't the old days.

39:33.520 --> 39:34.080
Either

39:34.800 --> 39:35.960
you get lost on your own,

39:36.400 --> 39:37.640
or my boys help you.

39:39.240 --> 39:39.760
Give it back.

39:39.760 --> 39:41.400
Give what back?

39:54.720 --> 39:55.400
I...

39:57.160 --> 39:59.040
Coming here looking for trouble?

40:04.800 --> 40:05.400
Impressive.

40:29.680 --> 40:30.200
Wu.

40:35.080 --> 40:35.640
Calm down.

40:35.920 --> 40:36.440
Wu.

40:37.120 --> 40:37.680
Calm down.

40:38.840 --> 40:39.400
Bro.

40:40.520 --> 40:41.360
Tell Cao Ping

40:42.440 --> 40:43.240
I want to see him.

40:55.880 --> 40:56.600
Welcome.

41:02.920 --> 41:03.640
You're out.

41:09.760 --> 41:10.440
What are you doing here?

41:14.520 --> 41:15.520
I wanted to see you.

41:19.960 --> 41:20.640
Seen enough?

41:20.880 --> 41:21.640
Can you leave now?

41:32.920 --> 41:34.200
How have you been these two years?

41:34.320 --> 41:35.080
What do you think?

41:35.640 --> 41:36.720
I think I've been fine.

41:38.280 --> 41:39.320
At least I had ironing to do.

41:44.720 --> 41:45.720
Go. Hurry.

41:46.320 --> 41:47.400
I need to go back and review.

41:47.760 --> 41:48.560
I have an exam next week.

41:58.000 --> 41:59.080
Then I'll wait until after your exam

41:59.080 --> 41:59.880
and come see you again.

42:02.440 --> 42:03.440
Don't come again.

42:03.640 --> 42:04.440
I don't want others to know

42:04.440 --> 42:05.280
about our relationship.

42:44.240 --> 42:44.720
Hello?

42:45.520 --> 42:46.160
Hello, Brother Ping.

42:47.160 --> 42:48.320
Xing Wu wants to meet you.

43:06.320 --> 43:07.000
Xing Wu.

43:07.840 --> 43:08.680
Long time no see.

43:11.400 --> 43:13.000
You must hate me now.

43:16.840 --> 43:18.040
You think too highly of yourself.

43:19.240 --> 43:20.400
That matter, to me,

43:21.320 --> 43:22.360
was over long ago.

43:25.720 --> 43:26.680
It's over for you,

43:27.520 --> 43:28.320
but not for me.

43:29.200 --> 43:29.840
Cao Ping.

43:31.360 --> 43:32.120
Look forward.

43:32.840 --> 43:34.520
Stop holding on to the past.

43:37.400 --> 43:38.560
From the day I went to prison,

43:39.440 --> 43:40.840
I actually tried to look forward.

43:42.560 --> 43:43.120
For the past two years,

43:43.120 --> 43:44.680
every day, I worked to turn myself around.

43:45.200 --> 43:46.320
So I could get out sooner

43:46.320 --> 43:47.240
and reunite with my sister.

43:49.120 --> 43:50.200
What exactly do you want?
